 r←GetGroupHref group
⍝ Returns where the name of a group leads to from a breadcrumb: to the group's home page when it
⍝ has one, otherwise to the list of packages, showing just that group.
 :If ⊃0 G.INI.Get'Config:GroupHomePages'
 :AndIf HasGroupHomePage group
     r←'/',(GetVersion_REST'group-homepage?name='),group
 :Else
     r←Reg.VersionOf_REST,'/packages?group=',group
 :EndIf
